  "published": "2026-10-12T06:23:37.4Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.1.0 -- Table.LoadAsync loads CustomClass.xml (Settings.CustomClass, GetCustomClassXmlFilePath). Static Picklist options (_options.xml) join on the field cast to text (SqlDialect.CastToText), so they work on numeric fields in PostgreSQL; Table.GenerateSqlSelectAsync takes an optional dbProvider. Requires SI.WA.FM 2.1.0. 3.0.3 -- Fixes: Table.GetXml keeps every field attribute of the model, escapes values, closes Card/PrimaryKey tags and no longer writes max=\"\"; Profile.Tree.Save writes node files for nested folders; GetUiCell copies the settings.xml field tooltip (form cell tooltip still wins). 3.0.1: tooltip-text-align support -- GetUiCell resolves Cell.TooltipTextAlign from the form cell, falling back to the table field (values normalized to left / center / right, anything else ignored); form settings are written back with tooltip-text-align. Requires SI.WA.FM and SI.WA.Models 2.0.1. 3.0.0 (BREAKING, major release for nuget.org): PostgreSQL support added across WA.Core -- the same config XML / SQL now runs on SQL Server or PostgreSQL (Npgsql). All SI.WA.* packages moved to a new major version together; reference them with matching versions. SQL generation is now dialect-aware (SqlDialect) for SQL Server and PostgreSQL; APIs take a DataBridge instead of the removed EF DbRepository.",
